    "Questions are chosen by sha256 order of the group id, whole knowledge groups at a time, before any answer exists. The score of any probe is not an input.",
    "Shards are reviewed in order. The analysis set is the longest prefix of fully reviewed shards. Review out of order is refused.",
    "A row is dropped only when generation produced no answer or no hidden state, or when the review label is AMBIGUOUS or UNVALIDATED. Dropped rows are counted in the report.",
    "The gate runs at the fixed threshold 0.65 with the pre-registered ECE limit and the 20-per-class minimum. Nothing is tuned on this batch.",
    "If the gate fails, this batch is not used to refit the pair probe or to choose a threshold. Recalibration needs the reserve as a fit set and a fresh untouched evaluation set."
